  "description": "RBAC permission matrix: the single source of truth for BOTH test suites. backend/tests/test_permission_matrix.py sends each request to the real API (allow -> 2xx, deny -> 403); frontend permissions.matrix.spec.ts runs it through the client-side check used by the UI and the demo simulator. Keep in sync with the matrix in the RBAC plan. Single admin: nobody (not even the admin) can grant or remove the admin role or delete the admin.",
